 What's Changed\n* feat: client port from [client] port or a host:port target by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/289\n* fix: QUIC clients give up on a silent server within seconds by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/290\n* fix: one discover line per server, no wrong link-local zones by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/292\n* fix: PSK mismatch wording, -n durations, zoneless link-local, push retry noise by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/293\n* test: run the 64-stream TCP load test in its own binary by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/294\n* fix: let UDP receivers drain reordered stragglers before finalizing loss by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/291\n* feat: --config, XFR_CONFIG and /etc/xfr/config.toml by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/295\n* fix: review follow-ups for QUIC keep-alive, discover link-locals and -n TCP_INFO by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/296\n* docs: release prep for 0.14.0 by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/297\n* test: avoid occupied ports and bound the legacy UDP fixture by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/298\n* fix: preserve completed results after stdout closes by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/299\n* fix: raise the QUIC idle timeout to 10 s by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/300\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lance0/xfr/compare/v0.13.0...v0.14.0","mentions_count":1}
